    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Your pod has been captured by a cruel marine park - only you can rescue all the orcas to reunite your family!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723270/extras/b0c2fb9a1af5e7aeef08becea3dbe244.poster.avif?t=1718927798\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723270/extras/b0c2fb9a1af5e7aeef08becea3dbe244.webm?t=1718927798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723270/extras/b0c2fb9a1af5e7aeef08becea3dbe244.mp4?t=1718927798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWIM FOREVER</h2><br>In this &quot;Endless Swimmer&quot; game, you play an orca swimming through the ocean, catching fish and avoiding dangers. The simple one-button controls are easy for anyone to learn!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE VIBRANT BIOMES</h2><br>Your journey starts in a beautiful coral reef, but the quest to save your pod from cruel SlamWharf will bring you across the seas. Discover new food (and dangers) as you progress on your missions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESCUE YOUR POD</h2><br>Unlock 4 unique playable orcas - each has different skills, swimming stats, and personality traits. Bring your family together!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE CHALLENGES</h2><br>Through dozens of unique missions, master the seas to level up your character and unlock new sights. The challenge doesn't stop there - several stats are also tracked for each swim, so you can always increase your high scores.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK COOL POWERUPS</h2><br>Grab powerups from helpful bubbles to slow time, gain lives, shatter obstacles, and more! Catch 6 fish in a row and your orca will gain a special boost. Plus, as you level up, additional powerups become available, so there's always more to explore.",
    "about_the_game": "Your pod has been captured by a cruel marine park - only you can rescue all the orcas to reunite your family!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723270/extras/b0c2fb9a1af5e7aeef08becea3dbe244.poster.avif?t=1718927798\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723270/extras/b0c2fb9a1af5e7aeef08becea3dbe244.webm?t=1718927798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723270/extras/b0c2fb9a1af5e7aeef08becea3dbe244.mp4?t=1718927798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWIM FOREVER</h2><br>In this &quot;Endless Swimmer&quot; game, you play an orca swimming through the ocean, catching fish and avoiding dangers. The simple one-button controls are easy for anyone to learn!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE VIBRANT BIOMES</h2><br>Your journey starts in a beautiful coral reef, but the quest to save your pod from cruel SlamWharf will bring you across the seas. Discover new food (and dangers) as you progress on your missions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESCUE YOUR POD</h2><br>Unlock 4 unique playable orcas - each has different skills, swimming stats, and personality traits. Bring your family together!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE CHALLENGES</h2><br>Through dozens of unique missions, master the seas to level up your character and unlock new sights. The challenge doesn't stop there - several stats are also tracked for each swim, so you can always increase your high scores.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK COOL POWERUPS</h2><br>Grab powerups from helpful bubbles to slow time, gain lives, shatter obstacles, and more! Catch 6 fish in a row and your orca will gain a special boost. Plus, as you level up, additional powerups become available, so there's always more to explore.",
    "short_description": "Explore the sea and save the killer whales in this &quot;Endless Swimmer&quot; game. Discover unique biomes, orcas, powerups, and more!",
